---
import BaseLayout from '@theme/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { getDictionary } from '@i18n/translations';

const locale = 'en';
const t = getDictionary(locale);
const updated = '2026-01-10';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — Chinese Baby Predictor"
  description="The terms of using chinesebabypredictor.com: entertainment-only predictions, no medical advice, intellectual property and acceptable use."
  enPath="terms/"
  locale={locale}
>
  <div class="pt-10">
    <div class="section-shell prose-custom">
      <h1 class="font-display !text-4xl font-extrabold !text-plum-900 sm:!text-5xl">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-plum-500">Last updated: {updated}</p>

      <h2>1. Entertainment only</h2>
      <p>
        chinesebabypredictor.com provides traditional-date-based <strong>entertainment</strong>. Predictions produced by
        the Chinese gender chart, the Mayan predictor, our quiz, planner and every other tool on this site are folklore
        artifacts with a roughly 50% real-world hit rate — the same as chance. <strong>Nothing on this site is medical
        advice</strong>, and no tool here can determine or influence a baby's sex. Only qualified medical testing (such as
        NIPT, amniocentesis, CVS or ultrasound) performed by licensed providers can determine fetal sex, and you should
        direct all health decisions to your healthcare professional.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>
        You may use the tools freely and share result screenshots. You may not scrape the site at abusive rates, resell
        our content as a service, attempt to interfere with other users, or use the site for any purpose that violates
        law in your jurisdiction. Users in jurisdictions where prenatal sex determination is restricted — such as India
        under the PCPNDT Act — acknowledge that our tools are entertainment simulations that cannot determine sex; we
        support all laws promoting gender equality.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        The site's text, design, code, chart presentation and tool interfaces are © Chinese Baby Predictor. The
        traditional Chinese gender chart itself is public-domain folklore; our fact-checked blog content, lunar
        conversion engine and page designs remain original works. Fair use — quoting with a link — is welcome.
      </p>

      <h2>4. No warranty</h2>
      <p>
        The site is provided "as is". While we work hard to keep the lunar computations accurate to the underlying
        calendar data, we make no warranty of accuracy, completeness or continuous availability, and we are not liable
        for decisions made based on entertainment content. If a calculation looks wrong, please
        <a href="/contact-us/">tell us</a> — we fix things fast.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Third-party services</h2>
      <p>
        Our contact form passes messages through a Web3Forms-compatible processor; its handling is covered in our
        <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>. We may use privacy-respecting analytics to know which tools are popular.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these terms as the site evolves; material changes will update the "last updated" date. Continued
        use after changes constitutes acceptance. This document is a lay summary, not legal advice; consult counsel for
        specifics.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
